// Matches the course slide's own "Cost per week" table exactly: roles as
// rows, one column per week, a Total column at the end. Uses each role's
// own recorded weeklyCost, so it reflects whatever actually happened in
// this specific session (including any Market Scenario or news effects),
// not a fixed textbook number.
